{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C4\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C4\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C2最完整地承接了S05的心理变化，也保留了v6的核心经历；C1和C3文字完全相同，并列，其次；C4虽然更突出情绪展开，却丢失了部分关键的经验依据。keep：C2保留最全，尤其补出了靠近时害怕受伤、心软会停步、允许自己去爱和相信以及不拿责任衡量这份向往；C1和C3保住了主要内容，但省略了几层重要限定；C4缺少曾真实获得快乐这一依据，也没有明确写出允许自己去爱和相信。cover：C2既解释了安宁为何真实，又交代了它为何不是现实已经改变，还能解释愿望为何逐渐显得迫切；C4对迟疑、委屈浮现、渴望增强的段内变化交代得尤其好；C1和C3有情绪浮现与满足，却没有充分展开这一过程。lean：C1和C3步骤最少，前后因果也比较顺；C2虽然较长，但新增的心理步骤大多有承接作用；C4重复了不再硬撑、不再装坚强和承认向往几个意思。plain：C4的硬撑、防着受伤、难过不必解释等说法最接近日常经历；C1和C3也比较自然，叙述紧凑；C2内容最周全，但责任、实现、有用等判断集中出现，稍显解释性和概念化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "088ba24e-9e41-40b3-8dfc-f99b2f3ac047", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T004816033365Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.828, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:49:00.880038+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "04f82d5f5431b3b5edf660193f63fe06caa4cb4499c7efe816f6328ca68f4384", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_